Package: totaljs-developer-desktop
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Total.js <repository@totaljs.com>
Section: metapackages
Priority: optional
Depends: totaljs-developer-server (= 1.0.0-1), totaljs-openbox (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-conky (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-wallpapers (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-mozilla-source (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-vscode-source (>= 1.0.0), totaljs-chrome-source (>= 1.0.0), firefox, code, google-chrome-stable
Homepage: https://www.totaljs.com
Description: Total.js Developer Distro, desktop edition
 The server edition plus the Openbox desktop: the theme, the panel, the launcher, the terminal, the files,
 the wallpapers, Firefox, Google Chrome and Visual Studio Code (from the repositories of Mozilla, Google and Microsoft, not from ours). This package installs the pieces; each one is a package of its own and can be
 updated alone. To install it, install totaljs-developer-release, totaljs-docker-source and
 totaljs-mozilla-source, totaljs-vscode-source and totaljs-chrome-source first, update the lists of apt, and then this one.
